# A load_file target that ends its own top level early.
#
# In the VM this `return` ends ONLY this file and yields 7 to the load_file
# call; the caller carries on and prints "main-end". The AOT splices the target
# into the program, where the same `return` would end everything.
print of "inc-start"
return 7
print of "inc-after"
